{
 "concepts": [],
 "depends_on": [],
 "description": "AFFECT-COUPLING PHASE 2 (EMOTIONAL_SYSTEMS_UNIFICATION_DESIGN.md sec4, AFFECT_COUPLING_SHAPE_PREREG.md): the single reusable Rule that automatically couples a resident's PSI modulator state (AffectiveState, seeds/affective_state_core.json) and stable disposition traits (bigville_town100_world.py _PARAM_SPEC, transported by worlds/bigville_ocelot_adapter.py Phase 1) onto ANY node carrying a small affinity-tag shape -- matched generically via MatchEdge's own type-agnostic endpoints, not a coefficient hand-authored per decision type. OFF by default (coupling_on guard) and NOT added to boot_core.CORE_SEEDS/boot_all -- opt-in only, loaded the same way core_emotions/shared_arousal/hate_attribution already are (_ensure_emotional_core).",
 "edges": [],
 "id": "affect_coupling",
 "nodes": [],
